  "event_progress": [
   {
    "progress_zh": "尊敬的华为云客户：\n      2026/7/26  02:49（北京时间），华为云监测发现华为云国际站账号存在异常，可能影响您相关云服务的访问，目前工程师正在紧急修复，建议您尽快检查业务情况。相关进展我们会第一时间通知您。\n       如您有任何问题，可随时通过工单或者服务热线（4000-955-988或950808）与我们联系\n        感谢您对华为云的支持！",
    "progress_en": "Dear customer,\nOn Jul 26, 2026, 02:49:00 GMT+8:00, Huawei Cloud detected that an anomaly occurred in the Huawei Cloud International Site accounts. You may be unable to access related cloud services. We are working to resolve this issue. Please check whether your services are running properly. We will notify you of any updates as soon as possible.\nIf you have any questions, please submit a service ticket or call us at +86-4000-955-988 or +86-950-808.\nThank you for your support to Huawei Cloud!",
    "progress_occur_time": "2026-07-25T19:05:00Z"
